WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.843
And the results are remarkably consistent.

00:00:02.923 --> 00:00:05.975
UniMax outperforms both temperature settings,

00:00:06.055 --> 00:00:09.734
tau equals one and tau equals three point three three,

00:00:09.814 --> 00:00:13.075
on average TyDi QA across all three model sizes,

00:00:13.155 --> 00:00:17.947
and it beats temperature sampling on WMT21
translation at every scale,

00:00:18.027 --> 00:00:21.149
with the majority of language pairs improving.

00:00:21.229 --> 00:00:26.091
On high-resource languages it beats tau equals
three point three three,

00:00:26.171 --> 00:00:30.058
and only trails tau equals one at the very largest scale.

00:00:30.138 --> 00:00:33.051
On low-resource languages it wins outright,

00:00:33.131 --> 00:00:40.220
even outperforming tau equals three point three
three on Swahili despite seeing fewer Swahili examples.
